WEBVTT

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.750
I like... {gamma- hi I am confused no idea wtf is going on here but i'll assume someone else has this under control - note: i am using the workraw}

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.270
...Yuuki-kun.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.830
<i>I said it!</i>

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.740
<i>W-What should I do?</i>

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.160
Eh?

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.580
Haruna, you like Rito?

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.250
So it's like that!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.460
U-Um...!

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.720
Go ahead, Lala-san!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.600
No, you first, Haruna!

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.100
Eh?

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.400
What are you two doing in a place like this?

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.110
Nothing!

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.990
Yeah, nothing at all!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.530
Hey, what's up with you two?

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.320
Sorry, Rito!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.210
Sorry, Haruna.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:11.090
I never realized your true feelings. {TLC}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.670
I'm no good... Always thinking about myself...

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.550
No, Lala-san!

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:20.050
I didn't mean it like that.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.810
It's just... I don't want to keep any secrets from you anymore.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:30.690
Lala-san, you're an important friend of mine, and yet...

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.240
I'm really happy...

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:43.370
...because you feel the same way I do, Haruna. {TLC/Edit}

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:46.750
I guess it's because we're friends.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.750
Thanks for telling me.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:51.920
Lala-san...

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.920
I've decided!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.510
I'm going to cheer your love on, Haruna. {TLC}

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:02.390
But, I'm also going to cheer my own love on! {TLC}

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.560
Lala-san?

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.100
It's fine, for both of us to fall in love with him.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.400
After all, both Haruna and I like Rito.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.400
Let's both do our best!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.440
Is that all right?

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.400
It's fine!

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.990
So... what's going to happen to me?

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:37.050
<i>DOKI - Chihiro</i>

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:37.050
<i>DOKI</i>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:43.390
<b>fukigenna tenki moyou ga nori utsutteta aitsu</b>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:43.390
<b>不機嫌な天気模様が乗り移ってたアイツ</b>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:43.390
<b>That fellow was affected by bad weather</b>

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:49.560
<b>nanda! chotto naname ni sora wo miteta dake ka</b>

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:49.560
<b>なんだ！　ちょっとナナメに空を見てただけか</b>

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:49.560
<b>What! He's only squinting at the sky</b>

