00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.310
<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.310
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.310
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.900
<b>soredemo</b>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.900
<b>それでも</b>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:55.900
<b>Even so,</b>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.480
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.480
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.480
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.490
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.490
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.490
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.160
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.160
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.160
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.910
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.910
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:09.910
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.540
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.540
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.540
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:22.380
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:22.380
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:22.380
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.600
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.600
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.600
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:34.020
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:34.020
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:34.020
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:41.700
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:41.700
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:41.700
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.570
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.570
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.570
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:58.460
Motto To LOVE-Ru 34

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:58.460
<u>I love you 1{TLC}</u>

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.460
It seems like your headache is caused by fatigue and stress.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:02.050
I can prescribe you some medicine, but if we don't solve the root of the problem, {TLC}

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.470
the same thing will happen again. {TLC}

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.930
I see.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.720
I guess it's because of that guy after all...

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.350
That guy?

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:14.400
The truth is, four days ago, my pet ran away.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.690
It's a rare violent species known as "Mineralun."

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.780
Its name is Nuppul. {TLC} {Lenmaer: Nupuru}

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.280
I've never heard of such a species before.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.530
Sensei, if you see it, please let me know!

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.830
Hello! This is the Mikado Clinic.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.580
Oh, it's Haruna-san!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:36.040
The pool? I'll come, I'll come!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.040
I'm looking forward to it!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.380
It seems like Oshizu-chan doesn't know what stress is like.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.470
What a huge pool!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.350
What huge bouncy objects!

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.400
It feels nice!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.230
Nana, you haven't done any warm-ups.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.070
Stop being so uptight! {TLC}

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.860
Take this, Momo!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.450
Geez, Nana!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.660
My turn!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.370
Momo! Go easy on me!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.170
Yami-san, it's your first time coming to a public pool, right?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:19.500
Oh Mikan, you invited Yami too.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.260
Please stop looking at me with such dirty eyes.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.350
Rito, did something happen between you and Yami-san?

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.850
Not really...

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.560
Yuuki-kun!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.030
Haruna-chan...

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:49.110
Yahoo, Haruna!

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:50.410
Lala-san!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.000
What's up with you two?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.330
Nothing at all!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.210
I'm here too, you know!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.260
Geez, stop it!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:10.470
They seem to have got bigger, don't you think, Lala-chi?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.140
How shameless!

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.270
Kotegawa!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.310
I came to make sure you guys didn't get out of hand. {TLC}

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.650
Hey. Did you two come together?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.400
Want a cold drink?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.610
Shoo shoo!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:34.330
Eh? Kotegawa, aren't you going to swim?

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.370
I have to inflate this float first.

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.380
Let me have it.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.380
I'll do it.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.800
It's going to be pretty hard without a pump.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.340
Thanks.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.720
<i>Geez... Why is he being so nice?</i>

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:04.440
<i>And this swimsuit... I bought it in a rush when Lala-san invited me yesterday.</i>

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.400
<i>I hope he doesn't think it looks weird on me...</i>

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.440
It's cute.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:08.940
Huh?!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.410
What a cute cat float.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.120
It is, isn't it...?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.330
<i>How misleading! Geez!</i>

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.290
Here I come!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.630
Oshizu-chan!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.630
I'm coming too!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:39.350
Hey! Jump down as well, Rito!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:43.940
That Lala... she dragged me to a place like this...

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.270
Haruna-chan...

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.360
All right.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.160
Y-Yuuki-kun!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.240
Are you all right?

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.830
Rito, you were so cool!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.870
Hey, do it again!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.330
Like hell I will!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.170
Why? You looked so cool...

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.460
Right, Haruna?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.760
Eh? Um...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.140
But, you sure have changed, Rito.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:25.190
I never thought you would be able to have normal conversations with girls in swimsuits.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.270
It's not like that!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:30.900
I'm just trying not to pay any attention to their chests!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.820
Anyway, if it were the old you, you would have fainted already.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.580
This must be the effect of having Lala-chan in your life.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.540
Geez, I'm so jealous of you.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.710
Because of Lala...

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.040
Rito!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.590
<i>The effect of Lala-san...</i>

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.090
Hi!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:56.550
Is everyone well?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.350
Today is the day of Run and Kyouko's special performance!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.980
Everyone, enjoy yourselves until the fire inside you burns!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:06.190
Yay! Run-chan and Kyouko-chan!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.690
Let me have a lick!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.230
How cute! {Lenmaer: oshiri kawaii}

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.030
How cute! {Lenmaer: momo ja ne}

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:26.250
Motto To LOVE-Ru 35

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:26.250
<u>I love you 2{TLC}</u>

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.160
Cute!!!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.040
My emotions are overflowing!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.880
Please accept the feelings of my passion!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.600
Eh? Wha-

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.690
What is this?!

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.820
No!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.820
Let's get out of here, Run!

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:00.200
Sure!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:10.630
<i>The me who couldn't be around girls...</i>

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:15.050
<i>And to be able to come to the pool with Haruna-chan, who I like...</i>

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.590
<i>In a way, it might really be because of Lala.</i>

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.090
It's like this, Haruna!

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.890
Really, Lala-san?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.760
But...

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.980
What's wrong, Rito-san?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.350
Do you happen to have love problems?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.650
If you're all right with me, I can help you.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.940
But I'm still a novice...

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.280
What's this?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.000
It's slimy, Rito-san!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.090
Stop making weird noises like that!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.010
Rito? Momo?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.090
What is that thing?

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:03.720
This is...

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:07.140
...a primitive creature from the Aquian System, a Mineralun!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.020
It's a very rare creature!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.730
Why is something like that in the pool?

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:16.400
Now that you mention it, one of Mikado-sensei's patients said that his pet ran away!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.820
I think his name was Nuppul.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:20.450
Nipple?!{Nipple?!}{Lenmaer: Nupuru}{a pun perhaps?}{gamma- hi - i decided to change it to nipple like one of the suggestions. i really don't think this needs a TL note for someone to understand the pun...........just leave it like this please lol}

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.410
Hey wait!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.020
Where are you putting your face?! You beast! {TLC traitor?} {Lenmaer: hen na no na}{it actually says ke da mo no}

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:51.560
No, not there!

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.610
Stop touching me in weird places! {no}

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.280
Yami-chan!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:03.740
I don't really like fighting slimy creatures with slimy tentacles...

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.450
And since it's a liquid life form, it seems pointless to try and slice it.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:13.500
Nana! Since it's an animal, can't you persuade it to behave?

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.500
It's no use.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.130
Its intelligence is too low, so I can't even communicate with it.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.550
Haruna!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.420
Let me go!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.010
Haruna!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.010
Lala-san, you'll get eaten too!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:29.890
Sis!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:30.680
Onee-sama!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.520
Lala-sama!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:46.410
Hey, this looks like it's getting bad!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.620
Step back, Mikan. {Lenmaer: Mika}

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.410
Yami-san.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.420
Yami-san!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.170
It's slimy...

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.470
Yami!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.090
<i>Damn, even Yami...</i>

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.050
<i>If this goes on, the two of them will-</i>

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:10.720
Yuuki-kun!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:17.850
<i>Rito?</i>

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.560
<i>Yuuki-kun?</i>

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.940
<i>Who should I save first?</i>

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.780
<i>No.</i>

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.360
<i>I'll save... both of them!</i>

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.410
Haruna!

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.410
Onee-sama!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:30.910
Rito!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.460
<i>This isn't good. I have no strength left.</i>

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.420
<i>But both of them are safe, so this is...</i>

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.460
Oh no! I have to save him!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.050
You shouldn't, Lala-sama!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:49.390
If you get too close to it, it'll just suck you inside again. {This is a great angle}

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.600
But...

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.060
Oh yeah!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:55.520
If you hit the nucleus hidden somewhere inside that thing's body,

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.190
somehow, it might pass out!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.150
A nucleus?

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.940
If that's the case...

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.570
<i>Where's the nucleus...?</i>

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.240
<i>We're counting on you, Yami-chan!</i>

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.450
<i>I have to save Rito.</i>

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.390
Rito!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.600
Yuuki-kun!

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:12.590
It seems like everyone had a rough time!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:16.970
Nuppul-chan's owner is here, so you guys can take it easy.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.180
This is its original size?

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:23.560
It mixed in with the pool's water and it grew.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.690
How troublesome!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.860
Sorry.

